    {
      "id": "SRS",
      "guid": "92f49f0c-e032-42d9-a0de-0c5df3c4d103",
      "name": "ReqView Software Requirements Specification",
      "lastId": 245,
      "createdOn": "2019-04-01T07:49:41.469Z",
      "createdBy": {
        "name": "Libor Bus",
        "email": "libor.bus@eccam.com",
        "company": "Eccam s.r.o."
      },
      "lastChangedOn": "2025-06-04T14:35:19.397Z",
      "lastChangedBy": {
        "name": "Libor Bus",
        "email": "libor.bus@eccam.com",
        "company": "Eccam"
      },
      "helpRef": "ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148:2018",
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "179",
          "guid": "31e8bbd9-a741-47ec-9163-417a0eed9f17",
          "text": "<p><em>© Copyright by Eccam s.r.o. All rights reserved.</em></p>",
          "type": "INF"
        },
        {
          "id": "1",
          "guid": "abbd78ca-b069-4ea0-9457-104d2e72cff4",
          "heading": "Introduction",
          "helpRef": "8.5",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "2",
              "guid": "3acc2187-2a22-4525-ba60-b41e8c461f2d",
              "heading": "Purpose",
              "helpRef": "9.6.2",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "180",
                  "guid": "7ee38bfd-067c-4155-8e44-224f480e6da4",
                  "text": "<p>The main purpose of this document is to provide a working example of a <em>Software Requirements Specification</em> (SRS) based on ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148:2018 standard.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "guid": "5dc86839-ef47-4911-914e-147d21253fdb",
              "heading": "Scope",
              "helpRef": "9.6.3",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "32",
                  "guid": "f077d25c-cb26-46d2-89be-67b2627516ac",
                  "text": "<p>This document specifies SW requirements for user needs described <span style=\"text-align: start;\">&nbsp;in&nbsp;</span><em style=\"text-align: start;\">[DEMO-NEEDS]</em><span style=\"text-align: start;\">&nbsp;document.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><strong>Note:</strong> The document is not complete.</span></p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "36",
                  "guid": "21ae8c24-0721-466b-a0dc-f85208271261",
                  "text": "<p>The application allows users to:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/edit-document/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">Capture requirements specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/edit-document/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#edit-attributes\">Manage requirements using custom attributes</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/requirements-traceability-links/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">Set up requirements traceability</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/blog/requirements-traceability-matrix/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#traceability-matrix\">Browse the requirements traceability matrix (RTM)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/change-management/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#control-project-changes\">Control Project Changes</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/filter-and-search/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#filter-document-objects\">Filter</a> <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/review-document/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">and search requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/import-html-ms-word/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">Import requirements from MS Word</a> or <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/import-csv-ms-excel/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">Excel</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/export-docx/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">Export requirements to DOCX</a>, <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/export-xlsx/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">XLSX</a>, &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/export-pdf/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">PDF</a>, <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/export-html/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">HTML</a>, or <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/export-csv/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">CSV</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/requirements-traceability-links/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#traceability-reports\">Analyze requirements coverage and impact of changes</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/doc/review-document/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples#print-documents\">Print requirements specifications</a></li><li>Integrate ReqView with Jira project management tool&nbsp;</li><li>Integrate ReqView with Enterprise Architect modelling tool</li></ul>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "37",
                  "guid": "fef1c611-fd6e-4f2c-a088-564b71637765",
                  "text": "<p>The application stores documents as human readable files with open file format.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "38",
                  "guid": "2e47b12e-0d7e-40e3-a348-865dec03d572",
                  "text": "<p>The application runs offline without connection to any server.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "guid": "3348dd4f-3dff-465c-afa7-11bf80f39724",
              "heading": "Product perspective",
              "helpRef": "9.6.4",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "5",
                  "guid": "35606406-f8ea-4f5f-ab01-adbfc831ebf4",
                  "heading": "System interfaces",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.1",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "47",
                      "guid": "61412017-7f8d-447b-85c9-0f813b62a8ed",
                      "text": "<p>The application runs on Windows, Linux and Mac.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "6",
                  "guid": "b818ebd3-41f9-4a7c-87af-8f281d39c0d9",
                  "heading": "User interfaces",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.2",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "45",
                      "guid": "63a890bc-51c0-42cd-af9e-0039969a3fb2",
                      "text": "<p>The application GUI provides menus, toolbars, buttons, panes, containers, grids allowing for easy control by a keyboard and a mouse.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "7",
                  "guid": "b546714f-b696-4816-bf65-760713be73f6",
                  "heading": "Hardware interfaces",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.3",
                  "type": "SEC"
                },
                {
                  "id": "8",
                  "guid": "dce8317a-1c9f-4af4-b3fe-292de89c5bbd",
                  "heading": "Software interfaces",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.4",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "166",
                      "guid": "06964a20-0a59-4221-88aa-a7fb3233f542",
                      "text": "<p>The application allows import a structured MS Word document via HTML data format.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "168",
                      "guid": "0db3883f-26ce-4f0b-9dca-f391d9a70b83",
                      "text": "<p>The application allows populating a MS Word document with project data via HTML data format.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "167",
                      "guid": "9aeebf52-a5a3-4d10-8722-a071a7b6fa23",
                      "text": "<p>The application allows import / export a list of requirements from / to MS Excel sheet via CSV data format.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "169",
                      "guid": "f11974f8-47fb-4de0-9502-f03cc4b7f780",
                      "text": "<p>The application stores project data in JSON format to enable easy integration with 3rd party applications.</p>",
                      "type": "INF"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "9",
                  "guid": "e4ef2496-c912-4b40-babb-230cfbee7748",
                  "heading": "Communications interfaces",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.5",
                  "type": "SEC"
                },
                {
                  "id": "10",
                  "guid": "7fc1577d-1b59-44a4-bc06-7488c0b96903",
                  "heading": "Memory constraints",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.6",
                  "type": "SEC"
                },
                {
                  "id": "11",
                  "guid": "f3f810f8-afe6-43ab-a33e-7405ccee08e2",
                  "heading": "Operations",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.7",
                  "type": "SEC"
                },
                {
                  "id": "12",
                  "guid": "d2ba3d71-a50c-49df-afcf-697834a787fb",
                  "heading": "Site adaptation requirements",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.8",
                  "type": "SEC"
                },
                {
                  "id": "13",
                  "guid": "fa917181-7a58-4d48-8c40-db5112aa4e20",
                  "heading": "Interfaces with  services",
                  "helpRef": "9.6.4.9",
                  "type": "SEC"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "14",
              "guid": "bee467ac-cf99-47e3-80aa-a7759995b6c0",
              "heading": "Product functions",
              "helpRef": "9.6.5",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "49",
                  "guid": "a968173a-47ac-480d-a371-fc7c04986a6e",
                  "text": "<p>Product functions are summarized in Section <em>2. User Stories of NEEDS</em> document.</p>",
                  "type": "INF",
                  "links": {
                    "reference": [
                      "NEEDS-3"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "15",
              "guid": "cbac12e5-3a65-4e89-aaab-36f82febfbc8",
              "heading": "User  characteristics",
              "helpRef": "9.6.6",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "16",
              "guid": "c75e1437-b9eb-480e-a709-245d2dcd3cb6",
              "heading": "Limitations",
              "helpRef": "9.6.7",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "17",
              "guid": "382740d0-a1c6-4866-8ea0-58bc12027b4a",
              "heading": "Assumptions and dependencies",
              "helpRef": "9.6.8",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "18",
              "guid": "f1d0c012-8aff-4690-832a-03b1109692f7",
              "heading": "Definitions",
              "helpRef": "9.2.3",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "186",
                  "guid": "b0526dfb-6732-416a-bbe0-afee03646984",
                  "text": "<p><strong>Custom Attribute:</strong> Additional requirement property capturing additional requirements properties such as requirements source, status, priority, verification method, fit criterion, ...,</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "188",
                  "guid": "4b966abd-8314-40e9-86f2-486dc1a92665",
                  "text": "<p><strong>Document:</strong> A structured requirements specification capturing textual requirements for a given product or service.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "187",
                  "guid": "880faed9-3c9a-416e-aff2-6d79f12f0613",
                  "text": "<p><strong>Link:</strong> A directed association between related requirements allowing to analyze requirements coverage, gaps and impact of changes.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "189",
                  "guid": "4d8f7490-865f-4985-9e58-4ec6f131f252",
                  "text": "<p><strong>Link Type</strong>: Property of traceability links allowing to analyze links with different semantic independently, e.g., satisfaction and verification links.</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "19",
              "guid": "bf7a35e9-6508-4c09-9f6a-d7ccf5691b99",
              "heading": "Acronyms and abbreviations",
              "helpRef": "9.2.5",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "184",
                  "guid": "d91ed3eb-7746-429d-975d-4c63fdc2e43e",
                  "text": "<p><strong>CSV:</strong> Comma Separated Values</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "185",
                  "guid": "55af80b1-8272-47b8-895e-354e31a6e88d",
                  "text": "<p><strong>DNF:</strong> Disjunctive Normal Form</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "181",
                  "guid": "e35ecca6-a045-4fa4-9596-7f42bc6f873b",
                  "text": "<p><strong>ID:</strong> Identifier</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "200",
                  "guid": "6f3c5afc-b1aa-48c9-a600-e83a88b1782e",
                  "text": "<p><strong>GUI:</strong> Graphical User Interface</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "183",
                  "guid": "d71deb69-ea46-425b-8995-b35015418a8e",
                  "text": "<p><strong>HTML:</strong> Hypertext Markup Language</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                },
                {
                  "id": "182",
                  "guid": "0114d4f4-afd4-434c-a8ff-7040f7fdc5ee",
                  "text": "<p><strong>SRS:</strong> Software Requirements Specification</p>",
                  "type": "INF"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "20",
          "guid": "a0c09c59-756b-43fb-8e50-5a3ff44f924d",
          "heading": "Requirements",
          "helpRef": "9.6.10",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "21",
              "guid": "6b56a23e-c05f-4097-9295-4446f4df2936",
              "heading": "External interfaces",
              "helpRef": "9.6.11",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "22",
              "guid": "e033dea5-33b4-4e95-92d9-d003723f03b1",
              "heading": "Functions",
              "helpRef": "9.6.12",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "51",
                  "guid": "3ff4eb01-f371-4798-abee-5212a2cf4a48",
                  "heading": "File Operations",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "52",
                      "guid": "9e2bf801-7398-46fe-874e-30b3c6fa870c",
                      "heading": "Create Document",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "53",
                          "guid": "9180992d-50de-4549-8a0e-e3009f5e1c6b",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create a new empty document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-58"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "54",
                          "guid": "1a275816-1187-4b31-a012-4b292cf1169b",
                          "text": "<p>If the current document contains unsaved changes then the application shall allow users to save the changes before closing the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-58"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "55",
                      "guid": "6ebd5eb8-578c-4588-a014-9aa1923e34d1",
                      "heading": "Open File",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "56",
                          "guid": "eb0685b8-b40a-4582-9ed3-9515cc2a88fb",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to open a document from a chosen file.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-58"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "58",
                      "guid": "61d8f1df-04b1-4e68-9a79-1dc25e0937ad",
                      "heading": "Save Local File",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "59",
                          "guid": "5eecdff8-60e2-463f-88af-63ffa4cdcbeb",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to save the opened document into a file.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-58"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "60",
                      "guid": "43919c4d-cb1e-46d9-9008-cd0f5b4ce26f",
                      "heading": "Document Template",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "61",
                          "guid": "ee706ece-aa2f-4b2e-b728-9ac72e90f5f0",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create a document template file from the opened document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-14"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "62",
                          "guid": "68d46573-6217-4a2d-8a79-681e3285339b",
                          "text": "<p>Document templates shall store structure of document sections and definition and values of requirement attributes.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-14"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "63",
                          "guid": "24edae06-69eb-4cb9-86c3-b2379867fa3f",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create a new document from a chosen document template file preserving the structure of document sections and the definition and values of requirement attributes.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-14"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "71",
                      "guid": "a5331502-f024-4a93-b206-cc5c8662ed0d",
                      "heading": "Import",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "72",
                          "guid": "2b8e2c8d-aafc-4118-88bd-2b93a98535d7",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to import a MS Word document preserving structure of document sections and paragraphs, rich text description of requirements and images.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-27"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "73",
                          "guid": "d4ea7a8c-10ba-4abb-9756-505f4fb73a78",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to import a MS Excel table of requirements preserving section headings, levels, unformatted text description of requirements and values of custom attributes.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-71"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "74",
                      "guid": "3b0330d7-0c46-4145-9e20-d9df0122bd9c",
                      "heading": "Export",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "76",
                          "guid": "421512a1-4ac7-42c9-bad1-c5cc4edaa128",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to export the displayed document view to HTML.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-28",
                              "NEEDS-23"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "77",
                          "guid": "8f6f5469-dea3-4f33-9879-cf436f11cedc",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to export requirements to CSV.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-72",
                              "NEEDS-23"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "235",
                          "guid": "c5f7e759-17b8-4c67-86e7-bbbd89213a1f",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to export the current document to ReqIF.</p>",
                          "status": "Approved",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-84"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "78",
                  "guid": "1f87c808-3f88-494a-a2a8-f06e94070f35",
                  "heading": "Document View",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "79",
                      "guid": "6ea8ce06-3eea-46b1-bf99-2d4a88053056",
                      "heading": "Table of Contents",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "80",
                          "guid": "eb4ed29a-bf91-4fa4-bf01-030880a7a7a7",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall display the table of contents containing section headings organized according to their document tree hierarchy.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "81",
                          "guid": "1f498912-1755-4efe-8926-a0f1baf570bd",
                          "text": "<p>When user clicks on a document section in the table of contents then the application shall focus the section in the requirements table.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "82",
                      "guid": "cb320d6c-134d-4e3b-bb94-5deee1d539a4",
                      "heading": "Requirements Table",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "83",
                          "guid": "6575d585-782a-4db3-b352-46a5dd959500",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall display the document in a requirements table containing the following columns: <em>ID</em>, <em>Description</em>, <em>Discussion</em>, <em>Links</em> and a column for each custom requirement attribute.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12",
                              "NEEDS-17",
                              "NEEDS-32",
                              "NEEDS-68",
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "84",
                          "guid": "c6a58070-2169-4115-92be-cc565054f025",
                          "text": "<p>The <em>ID</em> column of the requirements table shall display unique requirement identifiers.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-32",
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "85",
                          "guid": "1ff1ec7c-105b-4dcf-bbb4-a297d7a6ef6c",
                          "text": "<p>The <em>Description</em> column of the requirements table shall display the section numbers, headings, requirement text descriptions and attachments.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-68",
                              "NEEDS-17",
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "86",
                          "guid": "81b12796-89c9-4271-a79c-23bec2d203f1",
                          "text": "<p>The <em>Discussion</em> column of the requirements table shall display requirement comments with information about comment author, date and text ordered by date and time.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-24",
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "87",
                          "guid": "99f71e0b-7643-414f-938a-c65c4515cd2e",
                          "text": "<p>The <em>Links</em> column of the requirements table shall display requirement traceability links grouped by link types.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-21",
                              "NEEDS-73",
                              "NEEDS-30"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "88",
                          "guid": "6c194076-a44c-4ffe-9e88-8a77a3308745",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to change width of each requirements table column.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "190",
                          "guid": "3b4916da-cd7e-48ec-b9ca-a7c58f62c7fd",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to reorder requirements table columns.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "89",
                          "guid": "41952f31-23e9-42e2-a79b-668cf98f36a6",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to show and hide requirements table columns except the <em>ID</em> column.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-73"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "90",
                          "guid": "bed27937-e5b4-499f-b014-0e7332494b59",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to sort all requirements table columns except the <em>Discussion</em> and <em>Links</em> columns by ascending or descending order.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-35"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "91",
                      "guid": "e7d8e737-8841-47a3-9aaf-267a883561a0",
                      "heading": "Detailed Information",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "92",
                          "guid": "58061c74-c8be-4979-b98c-c1a0fe7bbc26",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to show and hide a pane displaying detailed information about custom attributes, discussion, traceability links or history of changes of the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74",
                              "NEEDS-30"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "93",
                          "guid": "3e97c81e-bf63-41d6-9d4f-c4e5be1900ec",
                          "text": "<p>While the custom attributes pane is shown, the application shall display values of all assigned custom attributes for the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "94",
                          "guid": "c6eb00d1-af9a-454e-b807-7b5b7d875d4e",
                          "text": "<p>While the discussion pane is shown, the application shall display all comments for the selected requirement ordered by date and time.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "96",
                          "guid": "7bfb8d08-a141-46a6-b007-8237594294dc",
                          "text": "<p>While the discussion pane is shown, the application shall allow users to expand or collapse a selected comment or all displayed comments.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "97",
                          "guid": "d7b906b3-a011-4022-b818-5e070641e763",
                          "text": "<p>While a displayed discussion comment is expanded, then the application shall display the date, time, author and description of the comment.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "98",
                          "guid": "a6d6c40c-c589-4f8e-845a-eedec4ee57b5",
                          "text": "<p>While a displayed discussion comment is collapsed, then the application shall display the date, time and author of the comment.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "99",
                          "guid": "956fd99d-288e-4418-8a3b-2119040ea3fc",
                          "text": "<p>While the links pane is shown, the application shall display all traceability links starting in or leading to the selected requirement grouped by link types and ordered by ID of the linked object.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74",
                              "NEEDS-30"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "142",
                          "guid": "092ad7a0-81fa-4c64-91dc-5b3061f50e76",
                          "text": "<p>When user clicks on a traceability link then the application shall focus the linked requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-74",
                              "NEEDS-21",
                              "NEEDS-30"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "104",
                  "guid": "962ee448-b164-4de0-bb25-b3fc3a4bc90e",
                  "heading": "Edit Document",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "105",
                      "guid": "154f1c8d-a366-414e-8286-d35c0237fd8c",
                      "heading": "Document Structure",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "106",
                          "guid": "c84a100d-ff1d-417c-bff7-598ccbd52631",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create a new requirement and place it in any document section.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12",
                              "NEEDS-68"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "107",
                          "guid": "d4138097-3de7-4cc2-9205-a812d30df038",
                          "text": "<p>When users creates a new requirement the application shall assign it a unique ID which cannot be changed.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-32"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "108",
                          "guid": "41abf100-7a3c-4e83-873b-48ae78bd91e9",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to copy selected requirements or document sections within the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "109",
                          "guid": "52bc10ff-d33f-4d2a-8544-30a79ab743e8",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to move selected requirements or document sections within the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "110",
                          "guid": "4deae666-057e-4186-84b6-0705bb601e1c",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to mark selected requirements or document sections as deleted.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "111",
                          "guid": "5cbf9064-8e16-448e-8b0f-3e9fef67dc1b",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to undelete selected deleted requirements or document sections.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "112",
                          "guid": "5930a2a2-19d9-49fd-a9c6-dd4b719b6e13",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to permanently remove selected deleted requirements or document sections from the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "113",
                      "guid": "217df052-498b-4d9b-acef-e839fbf96cb4",
                      "heading": "Requirement Attributes",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "114",
                          "guid": "22d84e0c-667a-4311-a507-07b11df15df5",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to edit the heading of the selected section.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-12"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "115",
                          "guid": "60786aee-a78c-4fa3-993a-8c6a812a0105",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to edit the text description of the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-68"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "116",
                          "guid": "bd08ea3a-368c-4098-8d38-290a20aac23f",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to paste an HTML content copied from MS Word, Excel or other application into the text description of the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-68"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "118",
                      "guid": "2d4ae7e5-3275-4b79-bf4c-356fb101b23b",
                      "heading": "Custom Attributes",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "119",
                          "guid": "d5391be4-b88b-4f87-a39a-c47c023eacee",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to define custom requirement attributes and assign them a unique ID which cannot be changed.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "121",
                          "guid": "fffade5b-57ad-461c-b93a-eebb262488b2",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to set a type of each custom attribute as follows: boolean, integer number, real number, string, date, enum or XHTML.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "191",
                          "guid": "72d7887e-24af-46ee-a5e5-175c1aafa625",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to set one or more values for custom attributes of enumeration type.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "122",
                          "guid": "67baeb2b-36a3-4c13-b091-622f35f05729",
                          "text": "<p>When a user changes the type of a custom attribute then the application shall automatically convert all values of the attribute to the new type.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "157",
                          "guid": "aec61759-5ec6-4eae-935b-bfe7781ce37e",
                          "text": "<p>If the automatic conversion fails for any attribute value, then the application shall prevent the change of custom attribute type.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "120",
                          "guid": "65862962-dfd2-4da8-978c-2c55f91c5c2d",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to set an optional name of each custom attribute.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "192",
                          "guid": "d3e7b3ae-11f9-42e2-a31e-be40b675e907",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to remove custom attributes.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "193",
                          "guid": "cbef0ab4-56db-4f58-8577-aa2c9c21fc61",
                          "text": "<p>When a user removes a custom attribute then the application shall unset values of the attribute in all requirements.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-19"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "165",
                          "guid": "53ece1ea-1b5f-445e-89c1-75131ed1fc27",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to edit custom attributes of the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-69"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "123",
                      "guid": "d05a605f-d86f-4a41-831f-4468ac2f4fd2",
                      "heading": "Attachments",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "124",
                          "guid": "fd7e1bf0-8f0b-4038-a838-0ebd8d2a07bd",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to attach one or more images or documents (PDF, Word, Excel, Powerpoint, Visio, …) to the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "126",
                          "guid": "a599627e-7a60-4ced-9ddc-b91d93e6efaa",
                          "text": "<p>When a new attachment is added to the document then the application shall generate its unique attachment ID as a combination of the requirement ID and the original attachment file name.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "210",
                          "guid": "bcc3de4e-1d0e-4d94-b978-a2a79ac939fe",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall display preview of image attachments in the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "127",
                          "guid": "b2750a62-cad1-4597-9866-df83c68c2d87",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to save attachment files to the local file system.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "128",
                          "guid": "07828501-823c-4740-833b-869b35674fd1",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to update content of requirement attachments from a selected file.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "129",
                          "guid": "27709a48-48ff-44d6-943a-e095a44b1c13",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to permanently remove attachments from the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-17"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "130",
                          "guid": "0312a27a-9e48-4619-a6de-73fa5d76b8ac",
                          "text": "<p><strong>Example:</strong></p><p>This is an example attachment.</p>",
                          "type": "INF",
                          "attachments": [
                            "SRS-130_1_ReqView File Data Format v11.pdf"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "131",
                      "guid": "3d81ee95-2133-4700-b62f-dba603165bab",
                      "heading": "Comments",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "132",
                          "guid": "e8c164f7-ab10-4f10-8420-12f59a23b51b",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to comment the selected requirement.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-24"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "133",
                          "guid": "ccb73f29-0562-4110-92a7-162374b024d2",
                          "text": "<p>When a user creates a new comment then the application shall record the current date and time and the author of the comment.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-24"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "134",
                      "guid": "a3679e97-5bba-4973-94e9-b960eb09d83d",
                      "heading": "Traceability Links Configuration",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "135",
                          "guid": "77aa7b20-0395-4a61-95df-d6fd539a7411",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to define link types and assign them a unique ID which cannot be changed.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-16"
                            ]
                          },
                          "discussion": [
                            {
                              "guid": "d9b50166-ec62-483c-b28a-91638043e19f",
                              "comment": "<p>Examples: \"satisfaction\", \"verification\", \"reference\", …</p>",
                              "date": "2019-05-07T09:46:30.543Z",
                              "author": {
                                "name": "Libor Bus",
                                "email": "libor.bus@eccam.com",
                                "company": "Eccam s.r.o."
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "156",
                          "guid": "dda5d870-a305-4417-a51b-5074288d90b6",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to set for each link type its name and role name of the source and target requirements.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-16"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "138",
                          "guid": "8db3e13d-f24a-4334-afa2-b5520e6c7e11",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to remove link types.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-16"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "161",
                          "guid": "e8a15ee0-6308-4cb9-a830-3d496a9f064c",
                          "text": "<p>When a user removes a link type then the application shall remove all traceability links of the link type from the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-16"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "136",
                      "guid": "d940caa3-28c6-4686-aa2e-057921cfd487",
                      "heading": "Traceability Links",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "137",
                          "guid": "cd1225bb-d433-461a-9813-878d12c2d18f",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create directed traceability links of a chosen link type between selections of requirements or document sections.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-21"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "139",
                          "guid": "86de1779-640a-4844-9129-61de60ec8ccc",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to change the link type of a selected link traceability.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-21"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "140",
                          "guid": "c50ba614-f14c-4cd6-a893-33917e854ffb",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to revert direction of a selected traceability link.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-21"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "141",
                          "guid": "306f0cd7-2a6c-402b-9591-a4d79827917a",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to permanently remove a selected traceability link from the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-21"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "143",
                      "guid": "04047547-6151-449f-8e32-800be1dbaa5f",
                      "heading": "Auto Save",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "144",
                          "guid": "2ae949f7-1c7c-4d82-b4f7-86c5d867cc66",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall automatically persist all document changes and restore them when it is restarted.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "mitigation": [
                              "RISKS-26"
                            ],
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-33"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "160",
                          "guid": "494b27f0-5cf8-476b-a580-cb91924f6579",
                          "text": "<p>When user closes the document the application shall clear all persisted document data.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "mitigation": [
                              "RISKS-26"
                            ],
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-33"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "145",
                  "guid": "c76206fe-b633-40c3-be8c-5046cb64469c",
                  "heading": "Filtering",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "146",
                      "guid": "b54671b4-52f1-47cf-849d-53fc4127b08e",
                      "heading": "Requirements Filter",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "147",
                          "guid": "74ddcacb-d7ba-496c-bcc9-2b0322b61d87",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to filter requirements according to a condition in disjunctive normal form (DNF).</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-34"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "148",
                          "guid": "9bb5b6b9-80eb-44f6-9095-616b124e8979",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to enter a filtering condition matching document sections by their number or heading.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-34"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "149",
                          "guid": "dee5e63d-59ad-4e1f-bca9-48e96f01c9fe",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to enter a filtering condition matching requirements by their text description or a custom attribute.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-34"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "150",
                          "guid": "30648e00-a255-4036-a2cd-44e506629fb1",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to filter requirements with missing traceability links of a given type.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-34"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "151",
                      "guid": "d4464ee6-479b-4836-8c68-0441354a226d",
                      "heading": "Full Text Search",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "152",
                          "guid": "8e3921eb-c456-4fd8-a769-029ca3c0a7b5",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to search requirements matching one or more given keywords in an string or xhtml attribute.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-36"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "153",
                          "guid": "7cf012d5-d5bc-47cb-b69b-65f62e1b739f",
                          "text": "<p>While the search mode is active the application shall highlight the matched requirements and allow user to select the next or previous matched requirement in the document.</p>",
                          "status": "Released",
                          "type": "FR",
                          "verMethod": "T",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-36"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "154",
                  "guid": "f2d68c2e-ff33-4f8e-b5b3-cca7145806c4",
                  "heading": "History of Changes",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "159",
                      "guid": "28cad8df-b9a7-4601-9928-44f76f91c334",
                      "text": "<p>When a user changes a requirement the application shall record the current date and time and the author of the change.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-26"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "101",
                      "guid": "b86eccf4-cd65-47d3-877a-c33ccea79288",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall display all changes of the selected requirement ordered by date and time.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-26"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "102",
                      "guid": "5d0b9978-fdef-4ee8-856b-4fcbb6a170c7",
                      "text": "<p>Each displayed requirement change shall contain author, date &amp; time and description of the change.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-26"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "103",
                      "guid": "b243ba1b-e5cf-4246-a329-46a5b4fe2dbd",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to expand and collapse all changes in the <em>History</em> pane.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-26"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "162",
                  "guid": "0813038a-4b24-4823-a052-114d3a3d82b1",
                  "heading": "Reporting",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "163",
                      "guid": "73ba7588-a005-4a29-8d60-44a8437be41e",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to print the displayed requirements table.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-29",
                          "NEEDS-23"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "164",
                      "guid": "c80547d9-8852-47f8-830a-c0fca99f5f2f",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to create a PDF containing the displayed requirements table.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-29",
                          "NEEDS-23"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "236",
                  "guid": "0045cb22-1d4d-49b2-a1c2-53e195eb5b99",
                  "heading": "Integrations",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "237",
                      "guid": "84200e6f-5a14-4894-8cb6-03bd004508a9",
                      "heading": "Jira Cloud",
                      "type": "SEC"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "239",
                      "guid": "f2b1166d-e70a-41cf-b308-01986c0eb561",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to export requirements from a selected document to a given Jira Cloud project.</p>",
                      "status": "Reviewed",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-80"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "240",
                      "guid": "d2a8e490-be32-4dae-b84f-d5a230da1114",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to map requirements type to a Jira work type.</p>",
                      "status": "Reviewed",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-80"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "241",
                      "guid": "7305260f-064e-4c18-8831-5fb367c51418",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall set the summary and description fields of exported Jira work items from values of ReqView attributes.</p>",
                      "status": "Reviewed",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-80"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "242",
                      "guid": "4e84c78c-4de9-4732-a395-362f761c8b26",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall preserve values of Jira work item fields and Jira links set by Jira users when updating exported Jira work items.</p>",
                      "status": "Reviewed",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-80"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "243",
                      "guid": "35c77693-7d1b-4a0b-b5da-14a3a851837c",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users bidirectional navigation between exported ReqView requirements and corresponding Jira work items.</p>",
                      "status": "Reviewed",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-80"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "244",
                      "guid": "13548607-50bf-4052-ba06-d9289e5b08b5",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to update selected ReqView custom attributes from corresponding Jira work item fields.</p>",
                      "status": "Ready",
                      "type": "FR",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-81"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "238",
                      "guid": "65952fa7-53ed-4da7-8850-ac450e4ad6d1",
                      "heading": "Enterprise Architect",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "245",
                          "guid": "dae867f0-39bb-4bd8-8a47-bcca8d423d99",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to export requirements to an Enterprise Architect model.</p>",
                          "status": "Draft",
                          "type": "FR"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "23",
              "guid": "5647049c-8405-4e29-858f-fc29f4d7db07",
              "heading": "Usability requirements",
              "helpRef": "9.6.13",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "24",
              "guid": "e0735be9-4a0d-4588-b568-3358fb2aac44",
              "heading": "Performance requirements",
              "helpRef": "9.6.14",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "174",
                  "guid": "2e97d79e-0243-4a39-9238-50056381bf1c",
                  "heading": "Startup Time",
                  "text": "<p>The application should display the opened document within 10s after it is started.</p>",
                  "type": "NFR",
                  "links": {
                    "satisfaction": [
                      "NEEDS-39"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "171",
                  "guid": "3ec2b06c-1ce1-4b40-bf68-2510f093e5b1",
                  "heading": "Edit Response Time",
                  "text": "<p>The application should display updated values within 1s after user triggers the edit operation.</p>",
                  "type": "NFR",
                  "links": {
                    "satisfaction": [
                      "NEEDS-41"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "173",
                  "guid": "ffadcffa-e893-4048-860c-53f04fe28de2",
                  "heading": "Smooth Scrolling",
                  "text": "<p>While a user scrolls the requirements table, the application should not display scrolling jerks longer than 200ms.</p>",
                  "type": "NFR",
                  "links": {
                    "satisfaction": [
                      "NEEDS-44"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "170",
                  "guid": "1aaac032-7b5a-4976-9234-c6b4ee74f1c0",
                  "heading": "Document Size",
                  "text": "<p>The application shall allow users to open documents up to 10000 objects and 100 file attachments with total size up to 100MB.</p>",
                  "type": "NFR",
                  "links": {
                    "satisfaction": [
                      "NEEDS-44"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "25",
              "guid": "7c7140c6-2d81-44f2-9e8b-3ea1f48d54b3",
              "heading": "Logical database requirements",
              "helpRef": "9.6.15",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "26",
              "guid": "d91d4a07-e4cb-416c-9486-f490148b3f7a",
              "heading": "Design constraints",
              "helpRef": "9.6.16",
              "type": "SEC"
            },
            {
              "id": "27",
              "guid": "09b8bff5-7c20-4b38-bb17-51433ec9d06b",
              "heading": "Standards compliance",
              "helpRef": "9.6.17",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "204",
                  "guid": "f56ffc5b-abc3-4741-b750-2e2166a790d3",
                  "text": "<p>The application shall comply with <em>OWASP</em> <em>Application Security Verification Standard</em> (<em>ASVS</em>) - Level 1, see document [<em>DEMO-ASVS</em>].</p>",
                  "type": "NFR",
                  "links": {
                    "satisfaction": [
                      "ASVS-456"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "28",
              "guid": "0a1c553a-de61-4add-bf58-befe0b7e3516",
              "heading": "Software system attributes",
              "helpRef": "9.6.18",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "212",
                  "guid": "1a65d996-4e65-443c-aaba-d5bf4fa9042b",
                  "heading": "Security",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "224",
                      "guid": "8b75512d-4bd1-47eb-a3e2-68f4f1e8ce67",
                      "heading": "Secure Input",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "205",
                          "guid": "aa31e427-272e-4be0-af73-c43f15b91355",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall validate all inputs entered by users.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-232",
                              "ASVS-233"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "206",
                          "guid": "f46aef10-edc4-4d33-9f98-f453eaf29b15",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall sanitize all inputs entered by users in a rich text editor.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-236"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "199",
                          "guid": "bf0a7684-3ea1-4f99-b057-a84f3edb8c81",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall sanitize all inputs imported by users.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "NEEDS-42",
                              "ASVS-236"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "207",
                          "guid": "e4003534-9720-4c6d-be6b-d5a679d874f6",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall prevent user to attach an executable file to project data.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-237"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "211",
                          "guid": "574b93ae-5cef-4353-9713-8a169052320d",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall not display preview of insecure SVG image attachments.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-242"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "208",
                          "guid": "4debb5f7-fef2-4f7e-9e44-99a6b7503a83",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall prevent user to attach a file larger than 10 MBs.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-237"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "209",
                          "guid": "43d97384-3ef8-4218-b14f-b244107102d4",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall not execute any code provided by users, which is not sanitized or running in a sandbox.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-239",
                              "ASVS-240"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "218",
                          "guid": "f01d5209-c4d3-4940-b18d-0db09d0a18bf",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall be protected&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: start;\">against JSON injection attacks, JSON eval attacks, and JavaScript expression evaluation.</span></p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-250",
                              "ASVS-263"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "225",
                      "guid": "5ab824be-17d8-47d5-8dde-976ceb698c4c",
                      "heading": "Secure Output",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "217",
                          "guid": "28ac2d9b-9aa3-445e-be47-c05a5ee1c2ab",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall escape all HTML exports.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-245",
                              "ASVS-246",
                              "ASVS-247"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "226",
                      "guid": "4c6c5648-edfa-4554-bb51-54e2fc7ddd48",
                      "heading": "Sensitive Data Handling",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "219",
                          "guid": "fc5808cf-7a53-405c-b1ed-886b5566571d",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall not store sensitive data in application logs.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-287",
                              "ASVS-288"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "220",
                          "guid": "efc33d81-2088-4f8c-97af-ddc1e9f3cdb9",
                          "text": "<p>The application privacy policy shall clearly explain how personal and project data are processed.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-318",
                              "ASVS-319"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "223",
                      "guid": "27e4700f-0510-4546-8163-be885b4d5360",
                      "heading": "Secure Build",
                      "type": "SEC",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "228",
                          "guid": "24b3dcfc-c18c-4616-a14b-c67a406e7b4c",
                          "text": "<p>The application source and configuration files shall be managed under a version control system.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-407"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "222",
                          "guid": "5ed8818a-6761-4a65-b397-4456f296af4a",
                          "text": "<p>The application shall be build in a secure image separated from the host environment.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-403",
                              "ASVS-406"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "227",
                          "guid": "93875563-fbc0-4056-9fa9-01e56fae028b",
                          "text": "<p>The application build shall be reproducible.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-406"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "229",
                          "guid": "a3c69164-5b01-4a86-9e4e-98ad4e467a0c",
                          "text": "<p>The application 3rd party dependencies shall be updated before building binaries.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-409"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "230",
                          "guid": "767c499a-58a7-423a-bda2-61dfcdba1a82",
                          "text": "<p>Unused application features, configurations, and 3rd party dependencies shall be removed before building binaries.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-410"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "221",
                          "guid": "a61b88ab-8cba-4954-81ba-d8fee2c7fc5b",
                          "text": "<p>The application executable binaries shall be digitally signed.</p>",
                          "type": "NFR",
                          "links": {
                            "satisfaction": [
                              "ASVS-347"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "215",
                  "guid": "7c29e9ef-bbbb-47e5-89bd-c78ff10c4d12",
                  "heading": "Portability",
                  "type": "SEC",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "195",
                      "guid": "4fedf9f7-567f-46be-b752-583c4575a862",
                      "text": "<p>The application shall run on Windows, Linux or Mac operating systems.</p>",
                      "status": "Released",
                      "type": "NFR",
                      "verMethod": "T",
                      "links": {
                        "satisfaction": [
                          "NEEDS-51"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "29",
          "guid": "1a22c42b-07bf-4a97-8492-6177bc2f7dc4",
          "heading": "Verification",
          "helpRef": "9.6.19",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "198",
              "guid": "f720f8e1-1d6f-45a9-84d2-c12bbaee0c1e",
              "text": "<p>Verification tests are specified in <em>[DEMO-TESTS]</em> document.</p>",
              "type": "INF"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "30",
          "guid": "b1945def-c739-4466-8564-51a3e644a6c0",
          "heading": "Supporting information",
          "helpRef": "9.6.20",
          "type": "SEC"
        },
        {
          "id": "31",
          "guid": "7a48c760-5a6b-4236-95f8-6f03d0942b67",
          "heading": "References",
          "helpRef": "9.2.4",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "177",
              "guid": "19719e5d-810a-431f-bc95-29c159a1fd76",
              "text": "<p><strong>[DEMO-NEEDS]:</strong> ReqView User Needs</p>",
              "type": "INF"
            },
            {
              "id": "216",
              "guid": "8b459b5b-b960-4915-934d-1d8735c5fc08",
              "text": "<p>[<strong>DEMO-ASVS</strong>]: OWASP Application Security Verification Standard</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "197",
              "guid": "c5b27ce0-08cf-420c-9247-df3d0fb497aa",
              "text": "<p><strong>[DEMO-TESTS]:</strong> ReqView Verification Tests</p>",
              "type": "INF"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
