    {
      "id": "ARCH",
      "guid": "c907e0e8-1982-429c-879b-d0d03d96b553",
      "name": "ReqView Architecture",
      "lastId": 18,
      "createdOn": "2019-09-10T14:01:32.469Z",
      "createdBy": {
        "name": "Libor Bus",
        "email": "libor.bus@eccam.com",
        "company": "Eccam"
      },
      "lastChangedOn": "2024-03-06T13:58:46.219Z",
      "lastChangedBy": {
        "name": "Libor Bus",
        "email": "libor.bus@eccam.com",
        "company": "Eccam"
      },
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "3",
          "guid": "d7543a42-f1cd-4386-9feb-ef2bef0063da",
          "text": "<p><em>© Copyright by Eccam s.r.o. All rights reserved.</em></p>",
          "type": "INF"
        },
        {
          "id": "1",
          "guid": "cf876f6b-1239-45b1-9431-4e30408f6721",
          "heading": "Introduction",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "4",
              "guid": "3ca3e96f-ff0e-41ca-9ad6-24e8ead0f457",
              "text": "<p>This document describes architecture of <a href=\"https://www.reqview.com/?utm_source=WebApp&amp;utm_medium=Application&amp;utm_campaign=Examples\">ReqView</a> application version 1.0, which implements functionality specified in <em>[DEMO-SRS]</em> document.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> This is an example document, which is not complete.</p>",
              "type": "INF"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "guid": "e3603963-b957-479e-9105-55156e43863c",
          "heading": "Architecture",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "18",
              "guid": "4a73a18f-bfa4-4523-b763-513742303d35",
              "heading": "Application",
              "type": "SYS",
              "links": {
                "implementation": [
                  "SRS-174",
                  "SRS-195"
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "7",
                  "guid": "1f13f99f-645a-4551-9724-02e27c4b940d",
                  "type": "INF",
                  "attachments": [
                    "ARCH-7_1_reqview_architecture.png"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "8",
                  "guid": "218cb8fe-e4ea-4981-86a7-01fc95775ab6",
                  "heading": "Widgets",
                  "text": "<p>Widgets displayed in the UI triggering events based on an user input</p>",
                  "type": "MOD",
                  "links": {
                    "implementation": [
                      "SRS-80",
                      "SRS-83",
                      "SRS-84",
